SUMMARY:Tax Literacy for Entrepreneurs
DESCRIPTION:Online seminar\, led by Canada Revenue Agency (CRA) professionals\, that will help you learn about: \n\nBusiness tax deductions\nCommon tax errors\nHelpful tools and services offered by the CRA\nGeneral bookkeeping concepts and best practices\n\nPlus: Get answers to your tax-related questions regarding small businesses and self-employed income. \nFor newcomers with Permanent Resident or Convention Refugee status who are 18+ years old. \nFor more information email Sarah at sahsan@culturelink.ca. \nTo register\, please fill out this Registration Form. \n﻿  \nFunded by Immigration\, Refugees and Citizenship Canada.
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/tax-literacy-for-entrepreneurs/
LOCATION:Online
CATEGORIES:Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Adults-Employment-CultureLink-Icon.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:CultureLink Settlement Services
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260424T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260424T153000
DTSTAMP:20260423T003817
CREATED:20260327T201401Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260327T201401Z
UID:10001907-1777035600-1777044600@www.culturelink.ca
SUMMARY:Networking Event with Scotiabank
DESCRIPTION:Meet and network with representatives from Scotiabank: \n\nLearn about the industry\nMake connections with people working in your desired role\nReceive advise for your job search\n\nParticipants must be: \n\nInternational trained professionals\nPermanent Residents or Convention Refugees\nAt least 19 years old\nJob-ready English proficiency level\n\nTo participate\, fill in the Registration Form. \nFor more information\, contact Rubina at rafsar@culturelink.ca or Victor at vgomes@culturelink.ca.
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/networking-event-with-scotiabank-2026-04-24/
LOCATION:CultureLink\, 2340 Dundas St W\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6P\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Adults-Mentorship-and-Networking-CultureLink-Icon.jpg
END:VEVENT
