SUMMARY:University Choices and Career Planning
DESCRIPTION:Your Future Starts Here! \nJoin this free session to prepare for University Enrollment! \n\nChoose the right program for you\nLink studies to career\nPlan your future\nMake smart decisions\nHow to apply\n\nFor Youth between 15-29 years of age who are Permanent Residents or Convention Refugees \nTo register\, fill out the Registration Form: \n﻿  \nThis event is funded by Immigration\, Refugees and Citizenship Canada \n 
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/university-choices-and-career-planning/
LOCATION:Online
CATEGORIES:Youth
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Youth-Employment-CultureLink-Icon.jpg
END:VEVENT
