UID:10001914-1777543200-1777552200@www.culturelink.ca
SUMMARY:Work & Study Permit Applications
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to apply for and renew Work and Study Permits online. This session covers creating an IRCC account\, completing applications\, preparing documents and avoiding common mistakes. \nPrimarily for refugee claimants and Convention Refugees\, but open to all. \nTo register\, Please email Ivana at itvrdonova@culturelink.ca. \nFunded by the Ontario Ministry of Labour\, immigration\, Training and Skills Development.
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/work-study-permit-applications/
LOCATION:Online
CATEGORIES:Adults,Newcomer Settlement Program
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Adults-Settlement-CultureLink-Icon.jpg
END:VEVENT
