CREATED:20260420T150656Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260420T150656Z
UID:10001909-1777576500-1777580100@www.culturelink.ca
SUMMARY:Smile & Save: Dental Benefits and Programs
DESCRIPTION:Join our Smile & Save: Dental Benefits and Programs (Online & In-Person) session to learn about affordable dental care options available to you. This informative workshop will help you better understand available supports and how to access them. \nThrough this session\, participants will: \n\nExplore available dental programs and services.\nUnderstand eligibility requirements for each program.\nLearn how to apply and complete the registration process.\nGain access to resources for affordable dental care.\n\nThis event is for Permanent Residents or Convention Refugees. \nFor more information contact Shane at SAquino@culutrelink.ca or (416) 931-6536. \nTo register\, fill out the Registration Form. \n﻿  \nThis event is funded by Immigration\, Refugees and Citizenship Canada.
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/smile-save-dental-benefits-and-programs/
LOCATION:Eatonville Library\, 430 Burnhamthorpe Road\, Etobicoke\, Ontario\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Adults,Families
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Adults-Settlement-CultureLink-Icon.jpg
END:VEVENT
