SUMMARY:Photography Tour
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a guided photography tour of the Ontario Legislation Building and to explore other hidden gems nearby. If you enjoy capturing the beauty of nature and architecture\, this is the tour for you! \nSecurity check: For the indoor portion of the photography tour\, an airport-style security check is required. Official government ID is required to enter. No large backpacks will be permitted in the building. \nRain or shine event: Dress for the weather as this is a rain or shine event. Be sure to bring snacks and water with you. Due to limited spots\, this is an adults only-event. \nFor newcomers to Canada (Permanent Residents and Convention Refugees). \nFor new participants fill out this Registration Form. \n﻿  \nReturning Participants reserve your spot via text to Rubeen at (437) 249-7103 or email at rchauhan@culturelink.ca. \nFunded by Immigration\, Refugees and Citizenship Canada.
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/photography-tour/
CATEGORIES:Adults,Sustainable Communities
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Adults-Mentorship-and-Networking-CultureLink-Icon.jpg
END:VEVENT
